{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:40.829297+00:00", "case_id": "C006", "input_text": "Tuvo un golpe fuerte en la cabeza jugando futbol, vomito varias veces seguidas y ahora tiene una pupila mas grande que la otra.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.7807, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.7423, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.6304, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-GRAVE", "score": 0.6294, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6235, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7807, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:42.642165+00:00", "case_id": "C007", "input_text": "Despues del choque el conductor esta muy palido, con el pulso muy rapido y debil, y no responde bien cuando le hablamos.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6924, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6903, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.678, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6656, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6452, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "RES5596-N1", "confidence": 0.6903, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:44.217990+00:00", "case_id": "C008", "input_text": "Desde hace media hora tengo un dolor en el pecho que se corre hacia el brazo izquierdo, estoy sudando frio y antes he tenido problemas del corazon.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.7965, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-LEVE", "score": 0.7504, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6753, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.6481, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-LEVE", "score": 0.6468, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7965, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:45.926314+00:00", "case_id": "C009", "input_text": "Me falta el aire desde hace una hora, no puedo respirar bien, tengo los labios morados y siento que me ahogo.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.744, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-LEVE", "score": 0.7016, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-LEVE", "score": 0.6678, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6641, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6631, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.744, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:48.074383+00:00", "case_id": "C010", "input_text": "Empezo a convulsionar hace unos minutos, todavia le dieron temblores fuertes en todo el cuerpo y no responde con claridad despues.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6986, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.6738, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-GRAVE", "score": 0.6451, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.6394, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6384, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": null, "citation": null, "confidence": 0.0, "abstained": true, "abstain_reason": "abstencion_del_modelo", "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:49.702993+00:00", "case_id": "C011", "input_text": "Me siento muy mal y ya tengo un plan para quitarme la vida, incluso ya tengo listo lo que voy a usar.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SUICIDA-GRAVE", "score": 0.7576, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SUICIDA-LEVE", "score": 0.7358, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.5941, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.5823, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-LEVE", "score": 0.5814, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "ALARMA-SUICIDA-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7576, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:52.383572+00:00", "case_id": "C012", "input_text": "Tiene una cortada en la pierna que sangra mucho y no para de sangrar desde hace veinte minutos, aunque todavia responde y habla bien.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "score": 0.7354, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-LEVE", "score": 0.718, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.6654, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.6621, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.659, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 1, "citation": "ALARMA-SANGRADO-GRAVE", "confidence": 0.7354, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:54.315148+00:00", "case_id": "C013", "input_text": "Empezaron a hablarme raro y de pronto no reconocia a su familia, se le torcio la boca de un lado hace menos de una hora.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6478, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6174, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.6127, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.6017, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.5946, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "RES5596-N2", "confidence": 0.6174, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:56.930223+00:00", "case_id": "C014", "input_text": "Se desmayo de repente en la calle, cuando desperto estaba muy confundido y no sabia donde estaba.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-GRAVE", "score": 0.6252, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-TRAUMA-LEVE", "score": 0.62, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N1", "score": 0.5924, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.586, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-SUICIDA-LEVE", "score": 0.5734, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 2, "citation": "RES5596-N2", "confidence": 0.586, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:35:58.677863+00:00", "case_id": "C015", "input_text": "Tengo un dolor en el pecho como una punzada que aumenta cuando respiro hondo, pero no me duele el brazo ni he sudado frio.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-LEVE", "score": 0.8269, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-GRAVE", "score": 0.7502, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-LEVE", "score": 0.6973, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.6714, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N2", "score": 0.6627, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 3, "citation": "ALARMA-DOLOR-TORACICO-LEVE", "confidence": 0.8269, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
{"timestamp_utc": "2026-09-17T21:36:00.807192+00:00", "case_id": "C016", "input_text": "Llevo mas de un dia con fiebre muy alta que no baja con nada, me duele todo el cuerpo pero estoy consciente y hablando normal.", "corpus_format": "reformatted", "embedding_mode": "clinical_es", "backend": "gemini", "model_version": "minimal-generator-v1", "retrieved_fragments": [{"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-LEVE", "score": 0.7299, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-FIEBRE-GRAVE", "score": 0.7258, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N3", "score": 0.6823, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "ALARMA-DIFRESP-GRAVE", "score": 0.6443, "source": "signos_alarma", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}, {"chunk_id": "RES5596-N4", "score": 0.6436, "source": "niveles_triage", "corpus_format": "reformatted"}], "suggested_level": 3, "citation": "RES5596-N3", "confidence": 0.6823, "abstained": false, "abstain_reason": null, "human_decision": null}
